## 🚀 Quick Start

### Initial Setup (First Time)
```bash
# 1. Environment validation
source scripts/utils/config-loader.sh
load_env_file
validate_global_config

# 2. Component setup trong order
./scripts/setup/db/setup-database.sh --default    # Includes Apple Silicon support
./scripts/setup/be/setup-backend.sh --default     # Python venv + dependencies
./scripts/setup/fe/setup-frontend.sh --default    # npm install + .env

# 3. Start services
./scripts/start-database.sh
./scripts/start-backend.sh  
./scripts/start-frontend.sh
```

### Daily Development (Quick Start)
```bash
# 1. Load environment
source scripts/utils/config-loader.sh
load_env_file

# 2. Start all services (với auto-setup nếu cần)
./scripts/start-database.sh --full-default-setup   # Optional auto-setup
./scripts/start-backend.sh --full-default-setup    # Optional auto-setup
./scripts/start-frontend.sh --full-default-setup   # Optional auto-setup

# 3. Access applications
# Database: localhost:1434
# Backend API: http://localhost:8000/docs
# Frontend: http://localhost:5173
```

## 🔑 Key Principles với New Architecture
1. **SQL optimization first** - Stored procedures > ORM
2. **No migrations** - Drop/recreate database each run với reset scripts
3. **Role-based access** - PGV, KHOA, SV permissions
4. **Environment inheritance** - Root .env → component .env với config-loader.sh
5. **Advanced script management** - Component isolation, health checks, confirmations
6. **Cross-platform compatibility** - Apple Silicon detection, platform-specific handling
7. **Terminal debugging** - Comprehensive logs, health reports over unit tests

