## 🛠️ Common Commands

### Database Operations
```bash
# Quick operations
./scripts/start-database.sh                    # Start với health check
./scripts/utils/db/db-health-check.sh         # Comprehensive monitoring

# Database lifecycle management
./scripts/utils/db/start-db.sh                # Start container only
./scripts/utils/db/stop-db.sh                 # Stop container only
./scripts/utils/db/restart-db.sh              # Restart container
./scripts/utils/db/reset-db.sh                # Reset với user confirmation
./scripts/utils/db/delete-db.sh               # Delete với user confirmation

# Network management
./scripts/utils/network-setup.sh              # Docker network setup
```

### Backend Operations
```bash
# Development workflow
./scripts/setup/be/setup-backend.sh --default # Initial setup
./scripts/start-backend.sh                    # Quick start
./scripts/utils/be/start-backend.sh           # Direct start

# Manual development
cd backend && source venv/bin/activate
uvicorn app.main:app --reload --log-level debug
```

### Frontend Operations
```bash
# Development workflow
./scripts/setup/fe/setup-frontend.sh --default # Initial setup  
./scripts/start-frontend.sh                    # Quick start
./scripts/utils/fe/start-frontend.sh           # Direct start

# Manual development
cd frontend && npm run dev
```

### Health Monitoring
```bash
# Service health checks
./scripts/utils/db/db-health-check.sh         # Database comprehensive report
curl -s http://localhost:8000/health | jq '.' # Backend health
curl -s http://localhost:5173/ > /dev/null    # Frontend health
```

## 📋 Development Workflow
1. **Research** → Read @DESCRIPTION.md, reference CẢ BA projects
2. **Environment** → Config loader validation, cross-platform setup
3. **Setup** → Component-specific setup scripts với platform detection
